WEBVTT

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.980
Dean Satomi is honoring us
with his presence today.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.800
Yes, what a blessing!

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.190
May the Heavenly Father's blessings

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.490
and divine protection always be with you.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.850
Thank you kindly.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.550
The holy priests here today
are all most becoming.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.070
It is such a delight!

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.070
A true delight!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.500
May God be with you.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.820
I'm amazed by how So can wag his tail
for others so easily.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.500
He isn't even a priest.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.710
Sosuke, I have the perfect job for you.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:35.760
Come help me.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.760
Or so Satomi said this morning.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.770
You truly have been good to us.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.810
Dear...

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.020
Are you ill?

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.530
Are you all right?

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.630
Golden eyes...

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.210
They're pretty.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:02.520
Nah, I'm fine... Ma'am.
The image of health.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.740
I'm glad to hear it.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.990
I was afraid that you must
be unwell for you to be here.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.040
Are you here on behalf of
a member of your family?

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.050
Well, I guess you could say that.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.360
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.050
The Church is your family, isn't it?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.670
May I sit next to you?

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.270
Doesn't bother me any.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.440
This is my first time here, so
I was feeling a bit forlorn.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:30.940
Don't you need to get in line?

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.130
You came for the anointment, didn't you?

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.090
That's right...

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:40.950
But I have no right to stand up there.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.080
If a pretty lady like you walked up,

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.960
I bet my friend who is working
up there would be delighted.

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.140
I think I'll pass.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.440
I'm leaving now.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:06.350
May you be blessed with God's
forgiveness and protection.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:10.880
Today...

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.150
...I met a little angel.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:53.070
A Lonely Figure

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.710
Sheesh!

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.790
Why must the Old Town
be so jam packed with people?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.190
Wait!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.170
Damn it! Out of my way!

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.010
Whoa, whoa!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:29.910
Asakeno?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.910
Sorry! Are you all right?

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:33.150
Yeah...

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.420
Just now, I'm certain I saw...

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.430
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:56.570
May you be blessed with God's
forgiveness and protection.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.220
He sounded a bit mature for his age.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.280
And those eyes were so pure...

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:05.380
He is a child from the House of God,
having been raised with love and care.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.700
He's nothing like my younger brothers.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.710
The next customer is here already?

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.790
Welcome to the "House of Winter Daphne."

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.790
My name is Kohaku.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.170
Do you find me to your liking?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.230
KONA-YA
KONA-YA

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.550
Goodness! Asakeno, you
still haven't changed?

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:49.240
Kokonoe, how could I have
forgotten about that...?

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.240
About that?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.250
There wasn't a single scar
on Sosuke Inukawa's face.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:59.250
That's right. He is not that man.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:03.840
Two years ago, that man stole
the lives of my family....

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:05.990
...along with my father's
beloved sword, Ochiba.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:09.260
It was forged to go with my
Ozasa as a brother sword.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.930
And then, that man, he...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.140
...he stole my heart
while I was still alive.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.940
Even though he had torn out my heart,

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.150
for some reason, I did
not die instantly.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.660
I was so desperate back then.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.530
I loathed the man! I burned
with the desire to kill him!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.240
Shino is eatin' dinner
with my bro at the moment.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.040
Thank you. I appreciate
your looking after him.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.880
Murasame!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.600
Jerk! How dare you steal my meat?!

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.600
Give it back! Give back my beef fillet!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.430
Impossible! I have bad night eyes.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.140
Your eyes have nothing to do with this!

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.550
Shino, try to behave yourself!

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.770
Sheesh.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.920
He could have mine if
he gave up on that piece...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.120
Why won't he eat it?

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.910
That's practically raw!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.750
I think it tastes best rare.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.540
It's nearly oozing with blood.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:22.040
That sounds messed up in
so many ways when you say that.

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:26.550
Wait, dammit! My beef fillet!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.680
That was close!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.940
What? It's just you?

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:37.180
It isn't safe to run around
in the middle of the night.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:41.620
Swingin' around a sword in the courtyard
is way more dangerous!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:45.690
You had excellent form.
Did you study under someone?

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.970
This is an heirloom that has been
passed down through the generations.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.840
My family motto said that
the wielder's strength

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:52.790
must match the blade.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.950
That's your family motto?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.540
For one to wield this sword,
you need that level of skill

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.290
or else it could put your own life at risk.

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.200
Yeah?

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.090
Having faced you once, I know that
you've still got a lot to learn.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.160
Would you like me to teach you?

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:11.730
No thanks.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:15.970
You're such a brat, you little...!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:15.970
Ow, ow, ow! Lemme go!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.140
By the way, Sosuke, do
you have any brothers?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:17.830
Let me go!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.480
Lemme go! Lemme go!
I'm not actually sure.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.340
You aren't sure?

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:27.480
You see, I've lost almost all
of my childhood memories.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.960
Amnesia...?

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:33.870
My mother never told me about any siblings,
so I doubt I have one.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.850
I see.

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.420
So he's a total stranger.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.980
In that case, I can cut
him down without reserve.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.710
Are you referring to the
man who looks just like me?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:46.910
Are you curious about him?

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.630
Well, as you can image...

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:50.750
Keno...

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:51.790
What is it?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:55.260
Why do I sense another person's aura
coming from inside of you?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.260
Huh?

00:08:58.730 --> 00:08:59.790
This aura...

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.300
It's just like...

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.590
It would seem that you've caught on.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:09.770
Kokonoe...

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.910
Shino, what do you think you're doing?!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.910
As I thought, it isn't making a sound.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:24.870
What?

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.530
That is only natural.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:34.170
What you will find inside
of that lad is my own heart.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.560
Kokonoe, no, Demon Princess...

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:40.380
I took him in.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.550
He was such a beautiful boy.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:47.570
His heart was already missing,
yet nevertheless, he was still alive.

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:48.630
What a mysterious boy.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.570
Fascinating!

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.920
If you want to live,
if that is your wish...

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:00.950
Wisdom

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.530
...then I shall provide what you lack.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.460
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.630
Kohaku! Kohaku!

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:14.150
What is it, Chitose?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.160
Don't give me that!

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.310
I've been calling for you,
but you wouldn't budge.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.340
Is it that time already?

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.340
You look horrible.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.350
Are you up to working today?

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.620
I'm fine. I just drank a bit
too much in the evening.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.860
Really!

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:31.260
And to think that the
customers never tire of you.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.500
You've got it good, you know that?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.870
They're only interested in
the unusual color of my eyes.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.700
What is it? Why the grin?

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:42.350
A dream...

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:43.850
A dream?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.000
I had a dream... about my brothers.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:49.970
Isn't it strange?

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.630
And here I haven't dreamt
about my family or village in years...

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.170
Hurry and get dressed. You've got work.

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:07.910
Perhaps it is because
I met that child...

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:23.160
Having been defiled... my
fate is merely to die alone.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:28.270
Did I have any right to stand
before those pure eyes?

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.280
Does anyone even come
to this rundown church?

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.090
Well, the red-light district
is just down the road.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:46.930
So? Why did Satomi send you here?

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.260
I don't know.

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:51.190
He said that I would find out
after I went and met with the sisters.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.150
I bet he wants you to
help anoint people again.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.900
Speaking of which, who were
you talking to yesterday?

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.980
Oh, you mean the pretty
lady with golden eyes?

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:05.980
In the end, she left
without getting anointed.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.790
Do you think someone
in her family is sick?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.120
Beats me.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.940
That unique smell...

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.050
I once had the same smell as her.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.460
The one running short
on time is probably...

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.060
...that lady herself.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.690
I heard that there is a
woman with golden eyes.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.360
Would that happen to be you?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.110
Who are you?

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.610
I'll be. You're already on the brink.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.260
That suits me well.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.000
His face...

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:52.950
It's the same as the priest
from the church yesterday.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.130
Say, care to cut a deal with me?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:01.590
He's a bit different from the priest...

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:07.640
If you give me those pretty eyes,
I will grant your heart's desire.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.240
Yes, it's just as if...

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.640
he isn't human.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.110
Don't you want to live?

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:25.190
Shino, calm down.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.360
I don't believe they
are spirits or demons.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.410
If they aren't, then
they must be mummies!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.120
What's this?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.350
'Tis most unusual
for young men to pay us a visit.

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.730
Did you lose your way?

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:39.920
Or did you come to attack
us little old ladies.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:42.220
That's quite the fetish!

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:46.830
Shino!

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:47.970
I can't take it!

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:51.230
Oh, look at him run! What a doll.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:52.770
Excuse me.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.390
Huh?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.150
I must apologize for
cutting your fun short,

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.810
but Mr. Satomi has sent me here on an errand.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.810
Satomi did?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.600
Egads! There were twin
mummies and a cockroach!

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:05.820
Where am I?

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.640
The leaks were something horrible
whenever we saw rain.

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.580
We lack money and there aren't
any men around to help.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:21.580
Good thing we went directly
to that Satomi boy for assistance.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.090
I can't believe Mr. Satomi...

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.370
Are you still searching
for someone, Asakeno?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:45.860
Who have you been patrolling
the streets for?

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.290
That is none of your concern.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.290
What are you doing, Shino?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:54.370
I found him back yonder. He was lost.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.370
Murasame, what's wrong?

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.380
There is a shadow.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:03.630
A shadow?

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:17.680
So...?

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.940
No, that's not him. That's...

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:26.760
So you've cut your hair, Shino.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.480
And here it was so pretty.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:32.610
Fiend!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.750
Unfortunately, it is not yet
time for me to come for you.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.700
They haven't fully gathered together.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:58.780
However, I am glad to see that
you are doing well, Shino.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:02.140
I was worried what might
happen to you way back when.

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.400
"Way back when"...?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.530
How does it feel to harbor
a monster in your body?

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:25.580
"If you wish hard enough, it
will definitely come true."

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.000
Those were your words.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.810
I'll see you around, Shino.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:53.700
Wait!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.370
He looked just like Sosuke.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:57.670
Do you know him?

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:00.830
No, I don't know him...

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:06.340
But he knew all about me.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:13.450
Don't you want to live?

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:22.980
If you give me those eyes,
I will extend your life by a week.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:31.470
I wish that I never met him.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.350
If it isn't Shii!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.740
Weren't you spending
the night at Kona-ya?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.650
Huh? He blew me off?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.250
There is a man who looks
identical to Sosuke?

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:46.290
Murasame called him a shadow.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.330
Sosuke doesn't have any
memories of his childhood,

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:52.550
but he remembered me from back then.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.840
You noticed that there were holes in
Sosuke's memories, didn't you?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:02.890
Do you know anything
about that man as well?

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.950
It's hard to say, but

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.310
haven't you suspected as much yourself?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.760
Sosuke is missing half of his soul.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.840
In this world, there is no such thing

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.360
as a creature that can live
with only half a soul.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.340
If he does not reclaim his other half,

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:25.390
his fragmented soul will eventually
be drawn to the underworld.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.770
Five years have passed
since he became that way.

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.010
Is the only thing still
binding Sosuke to his body,

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:34.370
Shino, your strong desire to
keep him amongst the living?

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.270
Shino? What's the matter?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.550
I kept waiting, but you never came back.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.000
So I'm here to bring you home.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.020
What's keeping you?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.750
This place is incredible!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.860
The roof is covered in holes.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.580
Plus it is a nesting ground for mice.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:01.000
They chew on the wiring, leaving
us without electricity.

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.280
First I have to shoo out the mice.

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:06.780
Shino?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.530
I saw him today.

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.790
The guy Keno's been searching for.

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:15.300
Did he bear that strong
of a resemblance to me?

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.480
I dunno.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.530
I didn't get a clear look at his face.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:23.640
Is that right?

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.250
And what is Keno doing now?

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:31.190
Asakeno?

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.170
Kokonoe, I've finally found the man!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.820
I'm sorry, but please don't
expect me to work for a while.

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:39.150
Do you truly intend to wander about

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.820
at this hour with your sword in hand?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.690
I know that he's in the
Imperial Capital right now!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:45.830
I'll finish him off
after I hunt him down!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.320
Asakeno!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.580
You are trying to hunt down a shadow...

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:00.840
Shadows are not so easily caught.

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:08.850
This could go on forever,
so let's work on the rest tomorrow.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.200
Please wait for me here
while I get ready to go.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:13.240
Okay...

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.870
If what Satomi said is true,

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:24.290
I have to find his other half,
the shadow that never offered his name...

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:30.150
I only have one week left...

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.090
I wonder if I can become
worthy of those eyes...

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.580
A beautiful lad is out
searching for you.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.390
I'm aware.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.540
Isn't he the owner of my heart?

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:00.400
But finding me will prove impossible.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.410
I am merely a shadow.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:12.000
The color of that eye is beautiful,
but there is only one.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.140
I made a deal.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.230
I will retrieve the other
eye before much longer.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.670
Shino took a liking to these
eyes, so I'm taking them.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.680
You love that boy, don't you?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.040
I can't say.

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.750
Back when we were children,

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:32.320
there were times when
I truly loathed Shino.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:35.690
Shino was weak yet still strong.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.890
I always felt as if
he was better than me.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:42.580
I am truly grateful that you
picked me up back then...

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:44.380
...Princess.

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:53.020
If you wish hard enough, it
will definitely come true.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:40.980
True Self

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.810
Shino, hold this.

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:29.570
What is it?

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.430
Next time you get lost, blow into it.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:32.560
I'll come rushing to your aid.

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:33.770
Nah, I'd rather not.

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:36.480
I'm always watching over you... always.

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:40.020
Officers, there's a pervert after me!
